Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.60,0:00:09.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I used my head a\Nlittle bit too much last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.66,0:00:11.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My shoulders are real sore.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.64,0:00:13.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They feel so heavy.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:21.29,0:00:28.76,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Shijima no soko kara
Dialogue: 1,0:00:21.29,0:00:28.76,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,From out of the stillness
Dialogue: 1,0:00:29.38,0:00:32.60,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Mezameru sono hashira tachi
Dialogue: 1,0:00:29.38,0:00:32.60,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,The Pillars of the past are awakening
Dialogue: 1,0:00:32.60,0:00:35.97,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Toki wo koe
Dialogue: 1,0:00:32.60,0:00:35.97,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,To the dawn of a new day
Dialogue: 3,0:00:35.97,0:00:43.23,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Shinku no chishio ga
Dialogue: 1,0:00:35.97,0:00:43.23,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,The river of crimson blood within you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.62,0:00:45.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you
Dialogue: 1,0:00:43.98,0:00:49.78,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Tachiagaru yuki wo hikiawaseru
Dialogue: 1,0:00:43.98,0:00:49.78,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Carries with it the courage to stand and fight
Dialogue: 1,0:00:43.98,0:00:49.78,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Tachiagaru yuuki wo hikiawaseru
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.42,0:00:52.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,very
Dialogue: 1,0:00:50.78,0:00:58.50,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Uketsugu ai wo sadame to yobu nara
Dialogue: 1,0:00:50.78,0:00:58.50,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Even if the love I feel is just part of my legacy...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.26,0:00:58.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,much.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:58.50,0:01:04.59,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Hohoemu me de tsugi no te wo
Dialogue: 1,0:00:58.50,0:01:04.59,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll still be smiling as I stay one step ahead
Dialogue: 1,0:01:06.38,0:01:11.22,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Yami wo azamuite setsuna wo kawashite
Dialogue: 1,0:01:06.38,0:01:11.22,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Defying the darkness and dodging death at every turn
Dialogue: 1,0:01:11.22,0:01:15.05,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Yaiba surinuke yatsura no suki wo tsuke
Dialogue: 1,0:01:11.22,0:01:15.05,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Slipping past the knife's edge and striking when you least expect
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.34,0:01:17.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:15.05,0:01:20.48,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Tsuranuita omoi ga mirai wo hiraku
Dialogue: 1,0:01:15.05,0:01:20.48,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,The emotions running through me blaze a path to the future...
Dialogue: 1,0:01:22.31,0:01:23.56,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Like a bloody storm
Dialogue: 1,0:01:22.31,0:01:23.56,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Like a bloody storm
Dialogue: 1,0:01:23.56,0:01:25.82,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Atsuku like a bloody stone
Dialogue: 1,0:01:23.56,0:01:25.82,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Burning like a bloody stone
Dialogue: 1,0:01:23.56,0:01:25.82,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Atsuku like a bloody storm
Dialogue: 1,0:01:23.56,0:01:25.82,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Burning like a bloody storm
Dialogue: 1,0:01:25.82,0:01:29.65,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Ketsumyaku ni kizamareta innen ni
Dialogue: 1,0:01:25.82,0:01:29.65,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,When the time comes to end the vendetta carried by our blood
Dialogue: 1,0:01:29.65,0:01:35.45,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Ukiagaru kienai hokori no kizuna
Dialogue: 1,0:01:29.65,0:01:35.45,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Remember that the bonds of pride will carry you through any storm
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.00,0:01:33.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uki araru kine nai hokori no kizuna.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:35.45,0:01:40.50,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Nigirishimete
Dialogue: 1,0:01:35.45,0:01:40.50,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,So hold them close
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.54,0:01:37.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Naoko yurishimete!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:45.59,0:01:49.59,Title2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1080,865)\blur1}Episode 18: "Stroheim's Unit Strikes Back" {Toni, Check that the title matches the preview at the end of 14 -Fadeout4}
Dialogue: 1,0:01:45.59,0:01:49.59,Title2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1100,865)}Episode 18: "Stroheim's Revenge!" {Toni, Check that the title matches the preview at the end of 14 -Fadeout4}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.80,0:02:00.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,today.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.76,0:02:01.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.14,0:02:03.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.54,0:02:05.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, white is always nice, but I think
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.02,0:02:10.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,something colorful can\Nbe kind of fun, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.16,0:02:11.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll let you decide.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.48,0:02:12.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.20,0:02:14.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.80,0:02:19.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the white one is pretty, but I really\Nlike the lovely design on this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.20,0:02:20.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder if
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.02,0:02:23.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo and Caesar have\Npassed their final exams.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.62,0:02:25.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have a bad feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.56,0:02:26.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm beginning to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.00,0:02:33.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So today, we're going to go with\Nthe pretty white. Susie Q. Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.90,0:02:37.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please send Suzi and Jojo to\Nmy room as soon as they arrive.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.60,0:02:39.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course, Signora.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.08,0:02:44.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know I said I like the white\Nblouse, but the other one is nice too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.52,0:02:45.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So which is better?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.78,0:02:49.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which do I choose? White.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.46,0:02:52.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But then again, this is really nice too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.18,0:02:55.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ay, what do I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.08,0:02:58.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The colorful one will\Ndo nicely, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.44,0:03:00.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excellent choice!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.34,0:03:15.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll just leave this\Nhere for you, alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.96,0:03:18.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll come back later and\Nclean up the broken glass.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.94,0:03:19.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be careful, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.26,0:03:21.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.12,0:03:45.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Susie Q.
