Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.50,0:03:50.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you screaming for?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.74,0:03:52.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be quiet, you stupid idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.84,0:03:55.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.62,0:03:57.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a stranger on the island!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.24,0:04:00.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.16,0:04:01.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think I'm a stranger?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.50,0:04:02.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's me, you dummy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.78,0:04:04.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joseph Joestar.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.08,0:04:05.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.99,0:04:06.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.91,0:04:07.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.96,0:04:08.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.22,0:04:12.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I saw you before, you\Nwere always wearing a mask.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.60,0:04:13.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, what a surprise!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.10,0:04:15.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.01,0:04:18.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you telling me you've never\Nseen my face in all this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.94,0:04:21.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, what do you think? Am I handsome?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.46,0:04:24.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.37,0:04:25.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Weird lips.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.04,0:04:31.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, they may be weird, but if we were\Never to fall madly in love with each other,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.32,0:04:35.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you'd be welcome to kiss\Nthem all you'd like.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.30,0:04:38.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, in your dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.26,0:04:45.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.90,0:04:48.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, nothing at all. Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.08,0:04:49.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.42,0:04:53.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Signora Lisa Lisa wants you to\Ngo up to her room right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.66,0:04:57.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But she is taking a bath, so you\Nshould probably wait half an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.94,0:04:58.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.86,0:05:00.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was planning to go anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.76,0:05:03.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got to tell her that\Nthey know all about the stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.32,0:05:04.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.23,0:05:07.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, you're not talking\Nabout her stone, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.68,0:05:09.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.12,0:05:11.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really don't want to get\Ninvolved in all this stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.66,0:05:12.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Believe me. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.16,0:05:16.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo, wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.04,0:05:17.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.14,0:05:22.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're actually pretty hot, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.42,0:05:31.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's odd.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.72,0:05:35.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My shoulders feel like they've\Nsuddenly started to loosen up.
