Dialogue: 1,0:05:40.65,0:05:45.16,Rings,,0,0,0,,{\an4\pos(296,690)\blur3}6AM, the ring around JoJo's throat is neutralized.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:40.65,0:05:45.16,Rings,,0,0,0,,{\an4\pos(296,760)\blur3}6 days remain until the ring around his heart dissolves.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:40.65,0:05:45.16,Rings,,0,0,0,,{\an4\pos(296,690)}6AM, the ring around Jojo's throat is neutralized.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:40.65,0:05:45.16,Rings,,0,0,0,,{\an4\pos(296,760)}6 days remain until the ring around his heart dissolves.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.50,0:05:47.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The news I have to report\Nis really important.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.06,0:05:49.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Lisa Lisa is taking a bath.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.78,0:05:51.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I'm going to have to\Nwait for half an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.56,0:05:52.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Until she's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.64,0:06:07.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I was told to wait then\Nwaiting is what I'll do now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.54,0:06:13.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where to spend half an hour I think the\NBest place is here by Lisa Lisa's door.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.18,0:06:16.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would it really be all that\Nwrong if I took a peek?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.72,0:06:19.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,through the keyhole to check things out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.10,0:06:25.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.18,0:06:32.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Susie Q?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.40,0:06:34.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute, what's she doing in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.62,0:06:36.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't even see her go into the room.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.34,0:06:38.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that was really fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.18,0:06:41.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought she was still out on the docks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.48,0:06:45.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.44,0:06:48.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The doorknob is completely\Ncovered in some kind of goo.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.04,0:06:58.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Susie Q, tell me, have Jojo\Nand Caesar made it back yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.16,0:07:03.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Susie Q.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.98,0:07:18.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you all right, Susie Q?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.74,0:07:19.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.90,0:07:21.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did you do with the red stone?
