Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.46,0:07:32.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.66,0:07:34.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me what you did with the red stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.92,0:07:36.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, this is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.46,0:07:40.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems something has\Ntaken over Susie Q's body.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.32,0:07:49.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You, you have reduced me to nothing\Nbut a brain with no body of my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.92,0:07:53.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But nevertheless, I challenge\Nyou to one last fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.80,0:07:58.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I put the stone on the boat\Nthat just left the dock.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.54,0:08:01.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am here to stop you from\Nchasing it and getting it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.04,0:08:06.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will not allow you to follow\Nthat poster boat, no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.30,0:08:10.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The woman I am inside of is\Nstill mostly alive, you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.60,0:08:12.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is only one way\Nfor you to destroy me
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.02,0:08:15.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,completely and that is\Nto take her life as well
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.36,0:08:17.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.04,0:08:19.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you capable of that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.80,0:08:23.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ACDC! Jojo!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.26,0:08:26.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You won't stop coming at us will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.48,0:08:27.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.28,0:08:29.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.18,0:08:33.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh Caesar, well, it's about damn time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.76,0:08:35.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.40,0:08:42.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you managed to survive\Nyour bout with ACDC?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.58,0:08:43.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a lucky one.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.74,0:08:44.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's for...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.82,0:08:47.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.73,0:08:49.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell were you doing\Nin here with our coach?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.06,0:08:51.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, cool it, you meathead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.82,0:08:53.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not like that, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.24,0:08:54.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just take a look at Susie Q.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.80,0:08:55.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.76,0:08:58.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.50,0:09:00.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's ACDC.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.50,0:09:02.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.41,0:09:04.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He somehow figured out a\Nway to make his brain and
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.70,0:09:07.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,blood vessels invade her\Nbody and take control of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.38,0:09:08.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Save me, Caesar.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.06,0:09:12.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.86,0:09:14.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone picks on me all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.56,0:09:18.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you'll never pick\Non me, Caesar, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.94,0:09:20.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't fall for a word of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.58,0:09:22.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Susie Q is not doing the talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.86,0:09:25.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ACDC is manipulating her. That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.78,0:09:29.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She managed to take the stone\Nand put it on a postal boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.26,0:09:32.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave this thing to Jojo\Nand me and find that boat!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.86,0:09:33.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get the stone back!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.10,0:09:37.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If the red stone reaches Venice\Nand is transferred onto a train,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.96,0:09:42.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we'll lose track of it and have no\Nway to know where it will end up!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.34,0:09:50.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not going anywhere, dickheads!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.06,0:09:55.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you want to stop that boat or leave\Nit all, you'll have to kill me first!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.78,0:09:58.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A male voice!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.68,0:09:59.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.06,0:10:03.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His blood vessels must be\Ncontrolling her from the inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.44,0:10:07.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, come on. Bring it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.22,0:10:10.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Use your hormone and kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.60,0:10:15.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It should be a relatively easy task for\Nyou to destroy me in my current state.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.34,0:10:16.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But then again,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.58,0:10:18.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you must know that this\Ngirl's heart isn't nearly
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.72,0:10:21.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,strong enough to endure a\Nhormone shock and survive it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.08,0:10:25.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you willing to snuff out this\Ngirl's life in order to defeat me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.58,0:10:28.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you are, then hurry up and do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.76,0:10:32.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quit standing there and wasting\Ntime, you stupid dickheads!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.78,0:10:34.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.30,0:10:37.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not soft-hearted, ACDC.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.60,0:10:40.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I have to do is end\Nthe life of one young girl,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.36,0:10:44.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I'll be able to save\Nthe entire world from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.48,0:10:47.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would consider it a small\Nbut necessary sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.12,0:10:49.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.14,0:10:51.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you serious, Jojo?
