Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.56,0:11:00.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, you can't! JoJo!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.88,0:11:04.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not kidding here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.26,0:11:05.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm really gonna do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.48,0:11:07.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it all!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.70,0:11:09.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just can't hit her!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.54,0:11:10.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.88,0:11:13.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought he'd pop out of her\Nwhen I started to make my move,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.60,0:11:15.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it didn't even faze him!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.94,0:11:19.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enough of your bluffing!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.84,0:11:23.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can never kill this girl\Nno matter how hard you tried!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.76,0:11:27.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hehehehe!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.90,0:11:38.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By now I'm sure the stone has\Nalready arrived on the main island.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.80,0:11:40.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're too late!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.40,0:11:43.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.58,0:11:45.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.88,0:11:48.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is he doing to Suzy Q now? Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.56,0:11:49.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't do this, ACDC!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.98,0:11:51.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now, just to make things interesting?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.06,0:11:56.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will make this girl's body\Nexplode and cover you all in blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.10,0:11:58.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that burns as hot as flowing lava!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.72,0:12:00.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.80,0:12:02.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His blood is boiling hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.12,0:12:06.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Suzy Q's body, it's\Nbeginning to fall apart!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.78,0:12:10.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If this keeps up, it won't be\Njust Suzy Q who'll be in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.28,0:12:11.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll be all of us as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.22,0:12:13.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, we have no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.12,0:12:17.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo, you need to use your\Nhormone on her right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.22,0:12:19.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.66,0:12:21.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.12,0:12:22.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please don't make me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.54,0:12:24.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm still having to deal with\Nall the horrible nightmares
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.02,0:12:28.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I get about the time I chopped\NVon Stroheim's leg off.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.08,0:12:29.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A different plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.36,0:12:31.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need a different plan right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.76,0:12:34.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.78,0:12:35.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll do it then.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.02,0:12:37.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, hold on a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.56,0:12:38.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Coach, let me do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.54,0:12:41.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, don't do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.30,0:12:42.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought of something.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.94,0:12:45.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Caesar, do you remember Helcline Pillar?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.16,0:12:46.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can give that a shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.62,0:12:48.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's do or die, so let's go for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.80,0:12:54.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You and me, two types of Harmon\Nat the same time. Two types?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.54,0:12:57.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I see what you're saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.34,0:12:59.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right, something\Nlike that might just work.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.96,0:13:01.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know what to do then.
