Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.04,0:13:46.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It worked!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.10,0:13:48.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You forced AC-DC out!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.34,0:13:52.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.96,0:13:53.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.22,0:13:55.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.76,0:13:59.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll just let the sun\Ntake care of the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.74,0:14:03.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That low-down, dirty scum!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.88,0:14:05.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hiding in a girl's body like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.88,0:14:07.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's nothing but a coward!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.60,0:14:08.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, Caesar.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.66,0:14:09.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.20,0:14:15.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I fought against him, so I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.00,0:14:18.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see, he gave all he had.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.12,0:14:20.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and even threw away his pride because he
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.34,0:14:22.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,felt a duty to get the\Nstone for his allies.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.16,0:14:28.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For thousands of years, he did as he pleased,\Nand he lived his life to its fullest.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.70,0:14:33.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whether it was good or evil, I respect\Nhis life and how he chose to live it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.34,0:14:39.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.38,0:14:49.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Susie Q,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.00,0:14:52.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,while ACDC controlled you,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.88,0:14:56.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you must have been at least\Nsemi-conscious most of the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.42,0:15:00.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now tell me, where is the stone headed?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.66,0:15:05.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Switzerland.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.57,0:15:07.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,San Moritz.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.04,0:15:09.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A package.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.28,0:15:13.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An envelope with Signora\NLisa Lisa's crest.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.18,0:15:16.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The address is...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.02,0:15:18.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Switzerland?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.93,0:15:21.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What about cars in Wamuu?\NAre they there? Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.26,0:15:24.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just checked with my\Ncontact at the station.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.56,0:15:27.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A cargo train for Switzerland\Nleft not ten minutes ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.22,0:15:29.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.13,0:15:31.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The stone has to be\Nsomewhere on that train.
