Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.62,0:15:33.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They've got a big head start,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.34,0:15:36.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but we've got to somehow figure\Nout a way to get ourselves to St.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.14,0:15:38.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Moritz before that train arrives.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.08,0:15:42.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to do everything we can to keep the\Nstone from falling into the wrong hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.68,0:15:45.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We might even have to do a\Nlittle bit of dirty work.
