Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.16,0:15:50.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A few laws might be broken as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.94,0:15:53.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some of us may even end up in body bags.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.16,0:15:55.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.78,0:15:59.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wasn't ready before, but now\Nthere's no way I'm gonna lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.72,0:16:01.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll eradicate every one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.94,0:16:04.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.94,0:16:06.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, we're out of here.
