Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.10,0:16:27.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Suzy Q! Look over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.92,0:16:31.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's goodbye for now, Suzy Q.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.66,0:16:35.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know when or how, but\NI'll be back in Venice one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.08,0:16:35.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promise!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.82,0:16:37.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.90,0:16:38.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.22,0:16:42.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Peel those ugly wounds on your\Nface before I get back, will ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.46,0:16:48.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Later!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.36,0:16:51.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo, be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.74,0:16:54.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make sure you come back\Nin one piece, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.72,0:16:55.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't get pushy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.04,0:16:59.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You may be an old lady before\NI get back, but I will return.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.70,0:17:02.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah?
