Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.36,0:18:04.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Screams
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.30,0:18:09.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, it drives a damned car, really? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.24,0:18:10.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's happened to your arms, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.00,0:18:11.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.72,0:18:14.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something's wrong with the wheel, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.20,0:18:15.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't get it to move.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.06,0:18:21.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.97,0:18:23.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ACDC hasn't reported back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.72,0:18:27.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He last said that he had learned\Nthe stone was somewhere in Venice.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.86,0:18:30.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder if something has happened to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.72,0:18:35.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Jojo. Jojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.32,0:18:38.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo, wake up!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:39.06,0:18:43.31,Title2.1,,0,0,0,,{\fscx96\pos(960,680)\bord3\blur2}5:00PM\N6 Days Until the Heart Ring Dissolves {This is a bit wordy, maybe fix the bottom line? Something like "6 Days Until Heart Ring Desolves" or "6 Days Until Remaining Ring Desolves"? -Fadeout4}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:39.06,0:18:43.31,Title2,,0,0,0,,{\fscx96\pos(960,680)}5:00PM\N6 Days Until the Heart Ring Dissolves {This is a bit wordy, maybe fix the bottom line? Something like "6 Days Until Heart Ring Desolves" or "6 Days Until Remaining Ring Desolves"? -Fadeout4}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.08,0:18:43.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo, we've caught up with the train.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.58,0:18:46.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're going through their\Ncustoms check at the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.42,0:18:47.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That works in our favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.92,0:18:52.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're less than an hour from San Moritz,\Nwhich leaves us enough time to get ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.60,0:18:54.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's good we caught up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.34,0:18:56.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Jojo. Look sharp.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.42,0:19:00.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, I'm just saving up my strength\Nfor the big battle, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.98,0:19:02.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get off my case!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.98,0:19:05.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's hurry up and get there\Nso we can retrieve that stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.98,0:19:09.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then we're going to need some sort\Nof plan for the fight with Wamu.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.52,0:19:11.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll wait for that until we cross.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.94,0:19:16.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.52,0:19:18.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Knock it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.68,0:19:21.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you want to go on, just\Nquit honking and pass us.
