Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.96,0:19:33.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, well, you're looking rather spry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.86,0:19:37.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My, you have grown so much, Joestar. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.94,0:19:39.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did you say, mister?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.58,0:19:42.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was that about?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.66,0:19:44.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.12,0:19:46.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.86,0:19:47.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.92,0:19:49.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know any German soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.92,0:19:51.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, look at the train!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.04,0:19:53.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So many soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.20,0:19:56.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Major, we found the package!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.58,0:19:57.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The crest.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.04,0:19:59.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, they've got the package.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.72,0:20:01.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and we all know what's inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.76,0:20:09.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Red Stone of Asia!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.80,0:20:11.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.12,0:20:12.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do the Germans want it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.88,0:20:15.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have decided to take this stone as a
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.24,0:20:17.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,specimen for our scientific\Nresearch program.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.84,0:20:20.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For the past three weeks,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.32,0:20:24.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we have been watching your every move\Nwhile you were operating in Venice.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.62,0:20:28.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We began the surveillance\Nwhen we lost our team in Rome.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.66,0:20:34.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We saw your training, we saw ACDC, and\Nwe knew you were chasing the stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.56,0:20:39.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, our base is set up at\Na lodge up ahead. Follow us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.64,0:20:44.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We want to ask a few questions\Nabout the stone and about cars.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.12,0:20:47.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why not work together, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.18,0:20:50.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all, we are not\Ncomplete strangers, Jojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.28,0:20:52.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.19,0:20:53.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you blabbering about?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.94,0:20:56.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't think you know anything\Nabout me, you bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.78,0:20:59.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If the Germans are here, that means...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.46,0:21:00.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do we do, Koch?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.48,0:21:02.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to follow them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.50,0:21:06.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least we know Crazy doesn't\Nhave the Redstone, either.
