Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.92,0:21:46.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll read the heat inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.22,0:21:48.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The fireplace is lit.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.76,0:21:53.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Four lights on the wall, two on\Nthe ceiling, two on the desk, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.10,0:21:54.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.01,0:21:56.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Four humans standing by the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.82,0:22:00.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Their heights are 178, 174,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.10,0:22:04.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,181, and 178 centimeters.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.12,0:22:09.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One human is by the fireplace,\N183 centimeters tall.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.56,0:22:13.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are five humans, all male.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.88,0:22:29.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One, two, that's four and five.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.86,0:22:38.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you must be cars.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.64,0:22:39.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.72,0:22:43.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In just a few hours you heard\Nabout your friend's defeat?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.78,0:22:45.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Learned that we had obtained the stone!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.00,0:22:48.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Found our location and have come for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.94,0:22:50.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very impressive!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.28,0:22:53.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then this brutal,\Nperfectly calculated assault.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.06,0:22:58.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not one of my men made even the\Nslightest sound before they died.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.24,0:23:01.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was sure there were only\Nfive men in this room?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.64,0:23:06.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now tell me, why can't\NI sense your body heat?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.96,0:23:08.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, rifle heads! What's...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.82,0:23:11.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what's a guy gotta do to\Nget a little food in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.94,0:23:13.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cars!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.38,0:23:16.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.54,0:23:18.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This man's mechanical.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.74,0:23:19.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.72,0:23:23.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're von Stroheim!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:33.43,0:23:37.02,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,I'll be the roundabout
Dialogue: 1,0:23:37.02,0:23:40.57,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,The words will make you out 'n' out
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.60,0:23:40.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take you out and out.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:40.57,0:23:45.90,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,I'll spend the day your way
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.58,0:23:43.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll spend the day your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.70,0:23:48.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Call it morning driving through the sun.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:45.90,0:23:48.57,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,Call it morning driving through the sound and
Dialogue: 1,0:23:48.57,0:23:53.04,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,In and out the valley
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.68,0:23:50.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And in and out the valley.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.12,0:24:03.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The music dance and sing.
Dialogue: 1,0:24:00.54,0:24:04.13,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,The music dance and sing
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.44,0:24:07.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They make the chill and drum really ring.
Dialogue: 1,0:24:04.13,0:24:07.72,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,They make the children really ring
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.62,0:24:11.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll spend the day your way.
Dialogue: 1,0:24:07.72,0:24:13.01,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,I'll spend the day your way
Dialogue: 1,0:24:13.01,0:24:15.64,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,Call it morning driving through the sound and
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.10,0:24:15.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cold in morning, driving through the sun.
Dialogue: 1,0:24:15.64,0:24:19.69,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,In and out the valley
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.82,0:24:17.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And in and out the valley.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.58,0:24:22.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In and out around the lake.
Dialogue: 1,0:24:19.69,0:24:22.07,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,In and around the lake
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.36,0:24:25.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mountains come out of the sky.
Dialogue: 1,0:24:23.36,0:24:25.57,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,Mountains come out of the sky
Dialogue: 1,0:24:25.57,0:24:27.32,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,and they stand there
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.64,0:24:27.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And they'll stand there.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.44,0:24:32.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One mile over, we'll be there.
Dialogue: 1,0:24:30.49,0:24:34.16,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,One mile over we'll be there and we'll see you
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.64,0:24:34.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we'll see you.
Dialogue: 1,0:24:36.91,0:24:40.58,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,Ten true summers we'll be there and laughing too
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.02,0:24:40.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ten and two summers, we'll\Nbe there laughing too.
Dialogue: 1,0:24:43.38,0:24:47.05,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,Twenty-four before my love you'll see I'll be
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.56,0:24:46.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Twenty-four, we'll fall by the real sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.22,0:24:49.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be there with you.
Dialogue: 1,0:24:47.05,0:24:49.93,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,There with you
